menu "RoboHub SHT4x module"

config RH_BOARD_SHT4X_MODULE
    bool "SHT4x temperature and humidity sensor breakout"
    select RH_DRV_SHT4X
    default n
    help
      An SHT40, SHT41 or SHT45 breakout on I2C (robohub ADR-0026). Selecting it
      brings in the driver and the I2C bus and timer it needs; an application
      that does not fit the module pays for none of it.

endmenu
